  <prompt>
    Delete the now-inert ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter and remove the transitional /api/v1/collab endpoint group
    (MapWorkforceCollaborationEndpoints + WorkforcePrincipalContextEndpoint + WorkforceCollaborationDownloadEndpoint +
    WorkforceCallerAuthorizationFilter), since the collaboration surface is now served principal-agnostically via
    CallerPrincipalResolver / ExternalCollaboration. Prove zero clients call /api/v1/collab BEFORE deleting.
  </prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer + BFF engineer. Follow ADRs strictly. Disciplined at safe deletion — caller-graph analysis before removal; suite-green after.</role>

  <goal>
    ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter (inert, superseded by CiamContactPrincipalStrategy, zero callers) deleted; the
    transitional /api/v1/collab group and its endpoints + filter (MapWorkforceCollaborationEndpoints,
    WorkforcePrincipalContextEndpoint, WorkforceCollaborationDownloadEndpoint, WorkforceCallerAuthorizationFilter)
    removed. The full BFF suite is green, no route regression on /api/v1/external, and publish stays ≤60 MB.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Per spec Scope→Cleanup + teams-app-r1 deviations D2/§7: ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter (:29) is now inert — its
      logic is reproduced in CiamContactPrincipalStrategy, zero callers. /api/v1/collab (MapWorkforceCollaborationEndpoints
      :133 → :142) was a transitional group superseded by the principal-agnostic ExternalCollaboration surface on
      /api/v1/external. Deletion is safe ONLY once no client calls /api/v1/collab. This runs after 015 (framework) + 016
      (OC as module over ExternalCollaboration) so the replacement path is proven live first.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/WorkforceCallerAuthorizationFilter.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalAccessEndpoints.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/WorkforcePrincipalContextEndpoint.cs</file>
