      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Authentication/AuthPolicies.cs</file>
      <file>src/client/external-spa/src/</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>015 (module framework) + 016 (OC registered over ExternalCollaboration) — the replacement path must be live before deletion.</dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">§10 BFF-touching: Placement Justification in the PR for the removal (cite .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md); run /conflict-check BEFORE the PR (teams-app-r1 shares this exact surface); verify publish ≤60 MB, report delta vs 46.90 MB.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Deletion is gated on proving ZERO clients call /api/v1/collab — grep all client surfaces (external-spa, any other SPA/PCF/solution) + integration tests before removing anything.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008">Keep the ExternalCollaboration route-group policy + CallerPrincipalAuthorizationFilter intact on /api/v1/external; only the transitional collab group + inert filter are removed.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Remove/adjust the collab group's tests per the deletion; keep the KEEP-path suite green; no orphaned test references.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-008-endpoint-filters.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-028-spaarke-auth-architecture.md</file>
